  - capacitor
  - local-ai
  - offline-voice
  - whisper-cpp
  - transformers-js
  - ffmpeg
  - pdf-studio
  - typescript
abstract: >-
  MUXARO is an offline-first media, PDF, and conversational AI workstation built
  with Next.js 16, Electron 35, Capacitor 7 (Android), Fastify 5, and on-device
  AI/speech engines (@huggingface/transformers, whisper.cpp, Piper, Ollama SSE,
  FFmpeg, yt-dlp, pdf-lib, pdfjs-dist, Tesseract WASM, and QPDF WASM).
